# Sanctioned multi-write service functions: `path::function  reason`.
# Each call site must be an exclusive branch or an idempotent retry, never two
# writes that both land for one logical change.
src/service/people.rs::set_member  exclusive match arms: remove OR set role
src/service/tasks/crud.rs::create_task_inner  if/else: signalled OR plain create
src/service/tasks/crud.rs::record_hook_event  exclusive match arms per hook kind
src/service/tasks/crud.rs::record_subagent_event  exclusive match arms per event
src/service/tasks/session.rs::report_rebase_done  one idempotent retry of the same report
src/service/tasks/session.rs::report_session_done  one idempotent retry of the same report
